*-------------------------------------------------------- 1111 keyword_replace_3
* SETEXIT FACE 9 -- THE HANDLER'S VIEW OF WHERE THE ERROR HAPPENED.  Companion to
* se_trap_undef: identical program, except the handler reports &LASTNO.  RED BY DESIGN beyond
* the trap rung -- g_core_err_stmt never advances in this tree, so every runtime error reports
* statement 0 (seat8, s194, named not fixed).  This row is what will notice when that is cured.
	SETEXIT(.H)
	&ERRLIMIT = 10
	X = NOSUCHFN(1)
	OUTPUT = "AFTER"
	:(END)
H	OUTPUT = "HANDLER S" &LASTNO
	:(END)
END
