*-------------------------------------------------------- 1115 keyword_replace_2
* SETEXIT FACE 2 -- AN ARMED TRAP TAKES CONTROL WHEN A RUNTIME ERROR OCCURS.
* The divisor is held in a VARIABLE on purpose: SPITBOL constant-folds 1/0 at COMPILE
* time, which is diagnosed before SETEXIT can ever arm, so a literal witness measures
* the folder and not the trap.
	SETEXIT(.H)
	&ERRLIMIT = 10
	D = 0
	X = 1 / D
	OUTPUT = "AFTER"
	:(END)
H	OUTPUT = "HANDLER " &ERRTEXT " S" &LASTNO
	:(END)
END
*-------------------------------------------------------- 1116 keyword_replace_4
*  Regression witness (conform-line-lastline-crash): &LINE / &LASTLINE where the
*  SOURCE LINE and the STATEMENT NUMBER DIVERGE. k14_stno_line cannot catch a
*  line/stno mix-up because there every statement sits on its own matching line;
*  here the comment runs and blank lines pull the two apart (stno 2 on line 4).

        OUTPUT = 'stno=' &STNO
        OUTPUT = 'line=' &LINE

*  another comment
        OUTPUT = 'stno2=' &STNO
        OUTPUT = 'line2=' &LINE
        OUTPUT = 'lastline=' &LASTLINE
END
