*---------------------------------------------------- 1566 benchmark_op_dispatch
* op_dispatch -- runs a value through a fixed add/subtract/multiply/divide chain N times.
* bottleneck: arithmetic operator dispatch and predicate test.
* Standalone:  scrip op_dispatch.sno   |   sbl -bf op_dispatch.sno   |   snobol4 op_dispatch.sno
        &TRIM = 1
        &ANCHOR = 0
        &STLIMIT = -1
        DEFINE('OP_DISPATCH(N)')                        :(OP_DISPATCH_END)
OP_DISPATCH  M = 1
        ZI = 1
ZBL     M = M + 3
        M = M - 1
        M = M * 2
        M = GE(M, 1000000) M / 1000
        ZI = LT(ZI, N) ZI + 1                           :S(ZBL)
        OP_DISPATCH = M                                 :(RETURN)
OP_DISPATCH_END
*BENCH kernel=OP_DISPATCH check=1000 bud=500 flr=20
