*  routed through rt_dyn_alpha_fn -> bb_ab_slot_for, a linear strncmp scan) start
*  resolving names AT RUNTIME.  Mode 4 (TEXT) compiles in a separate process that
*  exits before the linked binary runs, so the run process's table starts smaller.
