*  Same mechanism as beauty (551K rt_dyn_alpha_fn calls, avg scan depth 488.7 vs 104.2,
*  ~96% of beauty's 3.06x m3-vs-m4 run-only gap) at smaller scale; the DEFINE-count
*  landed-subset ceiling (128, lower_snobol4.c) caps how far this specific witness can
*  push the ratio.  See the FINDING for the full beauty-scale measurement and gdb trace.
